WEBVTT

00:11:28.322 --> 00:11:30.479
Energy efficiency
will be an important tool

00:11:30.503 --> 00:11:32.627
in the fight against climate change.

00:11:33.998 --> 00:11:39.271
So in closing, I'd just like to say that
Africa is a real place with real people,

00:11:39.295 --> 00:11:42.502
navigating complex challenges
and major transitions,

00:11:42.526 --> 00:11:44.822
just like any other region of the world.

00:11:44.846 --> 00:11:47.998
(Applause)

00:11:50.390 --> 00:11:53.055
And while each country and each region

00:11:53.079 --> 00:11:55.987
has its social, economic
and political quirks,

00:11:56.011 --> 00:11:58.577
the physics of electricity
are the same everywhere.

00:11:58.601 --> 00:12:02.354
(Laughter) (Applause)